# Pin line endings for files where build-time SHA512 verification depends on
# byte-exact reproducibility across platforms. Without an explicit eol=lf,
# Git's core.autocrlf=true on Windows runners converts LF → CRLF on checkout,
# changing the file's bytes and breaking SHA pins. v0.6.0's first CI run hit
# exactly this: vendor/pywebview/winforms.py SHA mismatch between WSL commit
# and windows-latest runner checkout.
#
# Scope: only files referenced by SHA-pinned workflow steps. Other files use
# Git's default eol handling.
vendor/pywebview/winforms.py text eol=lf
